WEBVTT

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.220
What on earth is going on?

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.720
There are strange phenomena happening all over the world.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.780
Is Manatsu safe?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.520
I don't know.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:37.280
But now I have no choice but to believe.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.330
Everyone, please calm down.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.140
First, the student who fell into the school building.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:36.290
Let's have the last cup of motivation power.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:47.960
The more motivation you get, the more it's worth it.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.090
I'll give you more motivation.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.960
Come on, let's go!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.290
I'm a servant of destruction created by the witch.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.780
Now, let's eat.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.090
Your motivation power.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.290
Stop it, Battler.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.780
Stop it.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.530
I don't think the witch wants that.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.860
We don't have the motivation to be taken away from us from the beginning.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.220
Are you going to betray me?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:49.270
Betraying is unfair to adults.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.420
You want to be a child forever, don't you?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.610
But this is...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:01.500
Let's go!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:09.890
Well, that's fine.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:14.900
The world will end anyway, so...

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:19.970
Don't say that!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:15.540
You don't intend to give us your motivation, do you?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.580
This time, I will return everyone's motivation!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:20.660
What?

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:29.980
It's enough, but today...

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.160
It can't be helped at this point.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:40.090
It's really troublesome, though.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:44.460
Kurikura!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:08.480
Thank you for watching!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:36.340
Well then, shall we counterattack?

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:55.540
Thank you for watching!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:33.780
I told you!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:35.680
Thank you for watching!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.720
The light of death does not reach the bottom of the dark sea.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:02.600
It's pitch black.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:03.950
Where are you guys?

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:08.240
I'm here.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:09.820
Papaya.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.290
I see.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.800
I was right next to you.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:17.630
I didn't know you could use it like this.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:18.880
I'm sorry.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.790
Let's use this kind of light at the theater.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:24.320
Sounds good.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.100
But the stage is bright outside, so I don't think it looks good.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.720
I see.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.860
I have to figure out how to show that side as well.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:37.920
That's right. I'm not going to end it here.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:42.520
I will definitely regain my motivation.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:46.710
I can't let it end without doing it as it is.

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:50.740
Yeah, there are still a lot of other things.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.960
I went to high school and started tennis again.

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.000
I want to deliver more kawaii.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:57.480
What?

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:02.800
I'm going to tell you a lot of stories.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:08.830
I'm going to take back the main town!

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.580
That's what I'm going to do!

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:16.680
The most important thing right now!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:29.380
HakuRuri!

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:31.560
That's enough, Battler.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.110
The witch is gone.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.270
Let's find another job.

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:40.750
The last resort is the best.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:41.950
Battler!

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:57.560
Let's devote ourselves to the

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.070
Is this the end of the world?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.740
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:05.050
Now, Lola, take this!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:12.910
I'm fine now.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:16.250
This is it.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:24.390
Everyone's motivation power is going back.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:33.960
We did it!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:34.600
What?

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.600
There are still things we don't know about the sea of Kodai.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.880
It's all thanks to you guys.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.460
Thank you, everyone at Precure.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:17.410
This...

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:21.450
That's probably the motivation of the Battler.

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.660
Ah, what a pain in the ass.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.080
I don't care about the destruction of the world anymore.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:33.200
I'll give it back to you.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.680
No, wait a minute.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.420
It's true that it's better to leave it as it is.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:40.240
If I put it back, I'll do something weird again.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.920
Then what should I do with this motivation power?

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.710
Then I'll take care of it.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.000
Can you do me a favor?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.980
Then, Your Majesty.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:58.110
Well, that's fine.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.380
Well then, thank you.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:07.360
By the way, I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused you.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.820
I'm sorry.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.140
Togi...

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:18.870
I hope that old man and everyone will have a tropical day together.

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:24.680
It's over.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.770
This is the end of the story.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:28.500
It's not over yet.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:29.340
Huh?

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.730
That's right! Let's go back and get ready!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:36.230
We're late for the schedule, so let's go get it back!

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:39.280
Yeah, let's get it going!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.930
Tropica Graduation Festival!

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:16.710
I think I'll just end it by saying that we've always been good friends and we've always lived together.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:25.380
Amen bo aina, pika pi kururun, kakiku keko!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.570
What's that, Lola?

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:29.530
I thought about it.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.070
It's a training for your vocal cords.

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:32.890
Tropicalb!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.640
Did you make a mistake in tomorrow's program?

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:37.970
What? Really?

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:40.140
I'll check it out. Come with me.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.260
Tropicalb!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:47.360
I'm here, but I can't believe it.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:50.800
I'll take a look.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:52.830
Hey, Tropicalb.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.440
I came to deliver this.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.500
Yeah, I'll take care of it.

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:57.740
Tropicalb!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:17:59.120
I want to stay today!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:01.580
Tropical Moon! Tell me!

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:03.410
Tropical! How about this?

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.090
Tropical!

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:07.320
You look busy.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.120
Well, yeah.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.070
Hey, Asuka.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:11.450
Hmm?

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:17.770
Did Asuka and the others save the world?

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:19.070
Huh?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:23.960
That can't be true, right?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:25.140
Hmm?

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:26.610
Huh?

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:28.140
Akizawa-senpai!

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:29.830
What?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:38.110
What the hell are you talking about?

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:38.530
I'm not talking to you!

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:42.260
I won't forgive you for what you did!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:47.120
Okay, I'm done with my investment training.

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.850
I finally remembered what I said.

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.480
I made it!

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.900
I'll give it to you.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.700
I'm looking forward to your stay today!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:02.500
Yes!

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:06.300
I also stayed and prepared for the cultural festival.

00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:07.380
Wow!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.910
It's time for sleeping bags!

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:11.090
Oh!

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:15.570
Will the pillow fit?

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.030
I'll sleep with this.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.370
I wanted to try it once.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.100
Sensei, please take care of Manatsu and the others.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.100
Leave it to me!

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.750
But there will be a new member again.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.140
Ah! Then I'll be a senpai too!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:40.590
That's right.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:43.340
I'm counting on you, Manatsu-senpai.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.220
Riki! Call me again!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.320
Manatsu-senpai.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:51.520
Don't get carried away.

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:57.120
Tetsugi-senpai! Senpai!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:01.750
Senpai

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.120
It's not bad at all, right?

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:04.820
Lola...

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.240
Something is coming out of the bread.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:06.840
Huh?

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:08.570
Of course.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:11.000
Of course!

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.270
Your acting is good.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:16.440
With this, tomorrow's performance will surely be perfect.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:25.440
You don't have to explain.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:45.770
I can't eat it

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:47.480
If it's like this...

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.000
I'm going to eat it

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:50.960
Tropical Change

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.450
I'm going to eat it

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:56.770
Huh?

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.380
What did you say?

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:06.840
The fairies also got well, and the city was rebuilt.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.090
The Grand Ocean will travel to a new sea from now on.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.830
To a different sea somewhere else.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:17.120
The day of departure is tomorrow.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.980
Laura, you did a great job.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:26.040
You played a great role as the queen candidate and protected the Grand Ocean.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.970
Thanks to that achievement, you are officially...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.980
I will officially appoint you as the next queen.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:36.720
I will officially appoint you as the next queen.

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:40.940
First, you will learn the rules of being a queen from me.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.860
Once you have decided to become a queen,

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.010
come back here by tomorrow's departure.

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.240
But if...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.020
If...

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:55.330
If you want to live with your friends in the human world,

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:56.840
that's fine too.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.120
You will resign from the throne of the queen...

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.870
It would be nice to stay in the human world forever.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:04.090
Laura

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:05.880
It's up to you.

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:31.450
We'll be right back.

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:58.650
It's the end of the Tropical Budo.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.580
Let's make our story stand out together!

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:05.900
Let's do the most important thing right now!

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:08.540
Tropicalage Precure!

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:09.910
Tropicale!

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:11.060
Our present!

00:24:11.240 --> 00:24:13.280
Let's be Tropical together!
